{"unit_id":"1010n111__dsh-about#card-zh","repo":"1010n111/dsh-about","commit":"288df99ead04faded32a3107b2e67188b6d46b21","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-about 是面向 DSH Web 的关于页面插件，会在设置面板末尾增加中英双语的“关于”页。它通过 Host 插件注册版本与更新日志接口，并由浏览器侧页面读取当前 DSH 版本、插件版本、项目主页和 DeepSeek Harness 更新日志。更新日志可展开查看，当前版本会高亮显示；界面使用 DSH 主题样式并可跟随语言设置。适合希望在 Web 设置中查看运行版本和项目更新的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH Web profile；不需要额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:470-501","lib/index.js:152-173","lib/client.js:258-349"]}
{"unit_id":"1010n111__dsh-about#card-en","repo":"1010n111/dsh-about","commit":"288df99ead04faded32a3107b2e67188b6d46b21","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-about adds a bilingual About page to DSH Web settings. It displays the running DSH and plugin versions, project links, and DeepSeek Harness release notes. Users can expand releases, with the current version highlighted. Requires a DSH Web profile; no API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:470-501","lib/index.js:152-173","lib/client.js:258-349"]}
